    <string name="ai_consent_title">Send text to an AI service?</string>
    <string name="ai_consent_gateway">To generate text, what you type here (topic, script text and options) is sent to RavanGo\'s AI server, which forwards it to Anthropic\'s Claude model. Nothing else from your device is sent. Your data is handled according to the providers\' policies. You can turn this off anytime in Settings.</string>
    <string name="ai_consent_anthropic">To generate text, what you type here (topic, script text and options) is sent directly to Anthropic\'s Claude API using your own API key. Nothing else from your device is sent. Your data is handled according to Anthropic\'s policy. You can turn this off anytime in Settings.</string>
    <string name="ai_consent_custom">To generate text, what you type here (topic, script text and options) is sent to the custom endpoint you configured, using your key. Nothing else from your device is sent. Your data is handled according to that provider\'s policy. You can turn this off anytime in Settings.</string>
    <string name="ai_consent_accept">Agree and continue</string>
    <string name="ai_consent_decline">Not now</string>

